    <string name="router_title">Who goes first</string>
    <string name="router_info">Every AI call of the app goes through one router. The page you are reading always goes first, even while chapters are translated in the background; then chapters and the review, then chat and search, then the home screen. The last 20% of every key's daily quota is kept for translation, so chat and the home screen never use it up. A key set to Automatic uses a light model for chat and extras and its strongest model for the review. A call that fails moves to the next key at once, and a key that keeps failing rests longer each time.</string>
